&lt;h2&gt;


  Summary
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Twenty is not just a piece of software; it represents a trend toward democratizing and making enterprise software transparent. If you are looking for a CRM that can be self-hosted, deeply customized, and doesn't sacrifice user experience, Twenty is undoubtedly the best choice today.&lt;/p&gt;




